{"title":"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/750b14dbe729feb30e16dc9f556f861d2a644027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/d/4dd7fe168284a0fd241c8697366281f6fae67014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/750b14dbe729feb30e16dc9f556f861d2a644027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def0cf0f13613c1ce9d085a7bfed8923174e0a32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5 - 3 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/d/4dd7fe168284a0fd241c8697366281f6fae67014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/3/4b3864d969e23793fcdc51b4ebd5e7a5fade4edf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2 + 4 = 4 + 4 = \\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"183\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Without_Finding_x.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Without_Finding_x)\">Solution 2 (Without Finding x)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Without Finding x)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/750b14dbe729feb30e16dc9f556f861d2a644027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b973846c6445e33b111ac19ec01fee74228e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(x + 3) = 2 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/4/f24041201f3798141c8cb8fc4f1487f679900876.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 6 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />. Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/caba4ded3e8bb4b815d77e6079f95ec00a8d5b80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 4 = 10 - 2 = \\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"171\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC\">2026 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">Team Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_1_Problem_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 1 Problem B (page does not exist)\">Relay 1 Problem B</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5\">Individual 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&